<description>&lt;p&gt;Syria has confirmed deploying troops to Saudi Arabia to fight the Houthis, while publicly denying any Syrian presence in Yemen. Syrian security forces killed a former aide to an Assad-era military commander in a clash in western Syria. The Syrian government and Jordan have signed cooperation deals as they seek to mend ties after deadly airstrikes. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/10/world/middleeast/syria-weighs-sending-troops-to-aid-saudi-war-with-houthis.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNLXNycnVSRjdCSmM2QTlSQ3FFcnd0Nnp4MkcxN2RrX1NHeERWVThvSEZyYi1saUlaZWhxNjJUak1RZ3NhdlB4NjN1VGtVdjY4a3lsaDJyVkU3ejEyNzNaTDdLX1Z5YXd4TFNCSS1JaFc2Qy1rVmF0QUVJTUw5Ym1zblpnTWc1UlA3amlyQ1U1TTNINHVUa1FOODdjYmtpTS1vc3h2ZVVVQi1EZzNTUHMwNW5tWHRHdzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera Centre for Studies&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxNdkdRX3ZKb0hFX0EtM25yamlZYWJ3dVh4UlZJelZWMmpSOVlSR3dzdVg1TEFoNmJoZFM4Q2dDeUtkQ1RCYWs1cFNsRlctRl9XeEF2VzM0N29BRzBMMlVhUVBEQmdHV0hwand0N0xGQ2JKZE0tR0NYaS1yRzBqN1JxcDg1ckxhRm96SThIeGVYcUlOY1ZLWVl3UG9senBxOGtOdk11TlMwT2haVEdoa1hvYXIwZjhZZXJCZkVmYUtfay1oS3lnOFJR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOdkNRNWlqZ0o1MEpaSmFUSkF3ZzU0eUhwaUlKS2tIZE51bUpqYmYyalE3VWI4d2VNMVN5Ni1MUDIxNzlpcUZMSzcwX0cybkx6V1VhNHhHRDFDN3RuOEZqVHJTR0NkMWxOMFQxLWxBclpfazh4MTdGZUVndDhYbjU0ZUNITG9OOUNCRTVnSHhFOFNTa1VzYzRiR1psTzNlanNrRFlWdWE2OHY5S1RGa2hv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Iowa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE9VeUtfZDUwazhfRkZWdC13My1nVExTYWh3V2tRLXlpcWtJ